%% D-4 家属端 + 端侧切真 · 时序图（对应 docs/design/D4-family-domain-design.md §5）
%% 断言口径：业务失败恒 HTTP 200 + R.code；未认证 HTTP 401 + code=10002；缺二次验证 200 + 10008
%% 7 条链：5.1 申请(含F2核验) / 5.2 机构审核 / 5.3 老人拒绝 / 5.4 解绑(④闸) / 5.5 家属读 / 5.6 elder↔user / 5.7 logout + 拒绝链路

%% ==================== 5.1 申请绑定（含 ★F2 核验） ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(家属)
    participant F as JwtAuthFilter
    participant A as PermissionAspect(第二闸)
    participant Id as IdempotentAspect
    participant Ctrl as FamilyBindingController
    participant S as FamilyBindingService
    participant Sup as SensitiveFieldSupport
    participant Codec as SensitiveFieldCodec
    participant VM as FamilyBindingVerifyMapper
    participant M as ElderFamilyBindMapper
    participant Ad as AuditLogAspect

    C->>F: POST /api/v1/family/bindings + Bearer + Idempotency-Key
    F->>A: 装配 LoginUser(perms/orgIds/dataScope=5)
    A->>A: 校验 account:family:bind（非敏感，无第四闸）
    A->>Id: 通过
    Id->>Ctrl: create(FamilyBindingCreateRequest)
    Ctrl->>S: apply(req, operator)
    S->>S: ① 频控 yl:fam:verify:{userId} INCR>10 → 10429
    S->>Sup: ② isAvailable()?
    alt 密钥未装配（dev 无密钥）
        Sup-->>S: false
        S-->>Ctrl: BizException(40001) —— 宁可拒绝，不可假核验；不落任何绑定行
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{code=40001}
    else 已装配
        Sup->>Codec: ③ hashForSearch(elderName) / hashForSearch(idCardNo)
        Codec-->>Sup: name_hash / id_card_hash
        S->>VM: countExactMatch(elderId, nameHash, idCardHash)
        VM-->>S: count（只返布尔语义，绝不返老人字段）
        alt count == 0（不存在 或 不匹配 → 同码防枚举）
            S-->>Ctrl: BizException(10004)
            Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{code=10004}
        else count == 1
            S->>VM: hasLoginAccount(elderId)（★C2：只返 boolean）
            VM-->>S: true → 落 0 ／ false → 落 1（§3.3 判定规则）
            S->>M: 查重(elder_id+family_user_id+deleted=0)
            alt 已存在有效申请
                S-->>Ctrl: BizException(10005)
            else 可创建
                S->>M: insert(status=0/1, familyUserId=登录用户, verifyMethod, proofCosKey)
                M-->>S: ASSIGN_ID 主键
                S-->>Ctrl: FamilyBindingView(status=0/1)
                Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{FamilyBindingView}
                Ad->>Ad: 写 audit_log(FAMILY_BIND_APPLY, ELDER_FAMILY_BIND)
            end
        end
    end

%% ==================== 5.2 机构审核 ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(ORG_ADMIN)
    participant A as PermissionAspect(第二闸)
    participant Id as IdempotentAspect
    participant Ctrl as FamilyBindingController
    participant S as FamilyBindingService
    participant DS as DataScopePermissionHandler(第三闸)
    participant M as ElderFamilyBindMapper

    C->>A: POST /family/bindings/{id}/approve + Bearer + Idempotency-Key
    A->>A: 校验 account:org:manage（★C1：ORG_ADMIN 独占；FAMILY 无码 → 20003）
    A->>Id: 通过
    Id->>Ctrl: approve(id)
    Ctrl->>S: approve(id, operator)
    S->>M: selectById(id)
    M->>DS: SQL 改写：scope=2
    Note over DS: elder_family_bind.elder_id IN<br/>(SELECT p.id FROM elder p WHERE p.org_id IN (myOrgs))
    alt 跨机构 / 不存在
        M-->>S: 0 行
        S-->>Ctrl: BizException(10004)（同码，不泄露存在性）
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{code=10004}
    else 命中且 status ∈ {0,1}
        S->>M: update status=2, auth_start_at=NOW()
        S-->>Ctrl: FamilyBindingView(status=2)
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{FamilyBindingView}
        Note over S: @Audit(FAMILY_BIND_APPROVE)
    end

%% ==================== 5.3 老人拒绝（★F1 死路修复） ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(ELDER)
    participant A as PermissionAspect(第二闸)
    participant Ctrl as FamilyBindingController
    participant S as FamilyBindingService
    participant DS as DataScopePermissionHandler(第三闸)
    participant M as ElderFamilyBindMapper

    C->>A: POST /family/bindings/{id}/reject + {reason} + Idempotency-Key
    A->>A: 校验 account:family:bind:reject（仅 ELDER 持码）
    A->>Ctrl: reject(id, req)
    Ctrl->>S: reject(id, reason, operator)
    S->>M: selectById(id)
    M->>DS: SQL 改写：scope=1（★F1 修复）
    Note over DS: elder_family_bind.elder_id IN<br/>(SELECT p.id FROM elder p WHERE p.user_id = 登录用户)
    alt 非本人老人 / 不存在
        M-->>S: 0 行
        S-->>Ctrl: BizException(10004)
    else 命中
        S->>M: update status=3, reject_reason=reason
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{FamilyBindingView(status=3)}
        Note over S: @Audit(FAMILY_BIND_REJECT)
    end

%% ==================== 5.4 解绑（④闸：OR 语义强制二次验证） ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(FAMILY/ORG_ADMIN)
    participant SVc as AuthController(/auth/second-verify)
    participant A as PermissionAspect(第二/四闸)
    participant SVG as SecondVerifyGuard
    participant Ctrl as FamilyBindingController
    participant S as FamilyBindingService
    participant DS as DataScopePermissionHandler(第三闸)
    participant M as ElderFamilyBindMapper

    Note over C: 前置：POST /api/v1/auth/second-verify 换取一次性凭据
    C->>SVc: {method, credential}
    SVc->>SVG: issue(userId)（TTL 300s）
    SVG-->>C: X-Second-Verify-Token
    C->>A: POST /family/bindings/{id}/unbind + Bearer + X-Second-Verify-Token
    A->>A: logical=OR：{account:family:bind OR account:family:unbind}
    Note over A: 注解含敏感码 account:family:unbind<br/>→ 无论靠哪个码进入，一律强制第四闸
    A->>SVG: verify(token, userId)（原子消费）
    alt 凭据缺失/失效/复用
        SVG-->>A: false
        A-->>C: 200 + R{code=10008}
    else 凭据有效
        SVG-->>A: true
        A->>Ctrl: unbind(id)
        Ctrl->>S: unbind(id, operator)
        S->>M: selectById(id)
        M->>DS: scope=5 → family_user_id=me ／ scope=2 → 经 elder.org_id
        alt 越权 / 不存在
            S-->>Ctrl: BizException(10004)
        else 命中
            S->>M: update status=4（deleted 保持 0，保留历史）
            Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{code=0}
            Note over S: @Audit(FAMILY_BIND_UNBIND, sensitive=1)
        end
    end

%% ==================== 5.5 家属读报告/详情/趋势/照护 ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(家属)
    participant A as PermissionAspect(第二闸)
    participant Ctrl as FamilyBindingController
    participant Q as FamilyReportQueryService
    participant BM as ElderFamilyBindMapper
    participant RS as FamilyReportSourceMapper
    participant CS as FamilyCarePlanSourceMapper
    participant DS as DataScopePermissionHandler(第三闸)

    C->>A: GET /family/bindings/{relationId}/reports|reports/{reportId}|trend|care-plan
    A->>A: 校验 report:view（五角色）
    A->>Ctrl: 读 handler
    Ctrl->>Q: 委派
    Q->>BM: selectById(relationId)
    BM->>DS: scope=5 → elder_family_bind.family_user_id = me
    alt relationId 非本人 / 未生效(status!=2) / 已过期
        BM-->>Q: 0 行
        Q-->>Ctrl: BizException(10004)（同码）
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{code=10004}
    else 命中生效绑定
        Q->>RS: selectPublishedPage(Page, binding.elderId) ／ selectReportById(reportId)
        RS->>DS: eval_report.elder_id IN (我生效绑定的 elder_id)；status=1 由服务层收口
        Q->>CS: selectConfirmedPlan(binding.elderId)（status=1 已确认）
        CS->>DS: care_plan.elder_id IN (我生效绑定的 elder_id)
        Note over Q: detail 额外校验 report.elder_id == binding.elder_id
        Q-->>Ctrl: 视图（脱敏；items_json→字符串列表，空态不造数）
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{数据}（code=0）
    end

%% ==================== 5.6 elder↔user 绑定 ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(ORG_ADMIN)
    participant A as PermissionAspect(第二闸)
    participant Id as IdempotentAspect
    participant Ctrl as ElderController
    participant S as ElderUserBindingService
    participant OM as SysOrgMemberMapper
    participant EM as ElderMapper
    participant DS as DataScopePermissionHandler(第三闸)

    C->>A: POST /api/v1/elders/{elderId}/user-binding + {userId} + Idempotency-Key
    A->>A: 校验 account:org:manage
    A->>Id: 通过
    Id->>Ctrl: bindUser(elderId, req)
    Ctrl->>S: bind(elderId, userId, authEndAt, operator)
    S->>OM: 查 sys_org_member（userId 是否 ∈ 本机构，status=1）
    alt 目标账号非本机构
        S-->>Ctrl: BizException(20003)
    else 合法
        S->>EM: selectById(elderId)
        EM->>DS: scope=2 → elder.org_id IN (myOrgs)
        alt 越界 / 不存在
            S-->>Ctrl: BizException(10004)
        else 命中且 user_id 未被他人占用
            S->>EM: update user_id=userId, auth_end_at=authEndAt
            Note over S: uk_elder_user 冲突 → DuplicateKeyException → 10005（不 500）
            Ctrl-->>C: 200 + R{UserBindingView}
            Note over S: @Audit(ELDER_USER_BIND)
        end
    end

%% ==================== 5.7 logout 黑名单 + 拒绝链路 ====================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端
    participant F as JwtAuthFilter
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant BL as TokenBlacklistStore
    participant RT as RefreshTokenStore
    participant EP as RestAuthenticationEntryPoint
    participant PA as PermissionAspect(第二闸)
    participant GE as GlobalExceptionHandler

    Note over C,GE: 链路① logout 双令牌失效
    C->>F: POST /auth/logout + Bearer A + {refreshToken:R}
    F->>F: parse(A) 成功；查黑名单（未命中）
    F->>AS: logout(A, R, userId)
    AS->>BL: add(sha256(A), userId, 剩余有效期秒)
    AS->>RT: revoke(R)（删 yl:rt:R）
    AS-->>C: 200 + R{code=0}
    Note over C: 旧 access A 已入黑名单；旧 refresh R 已 revoke

    Note over C,GE: 链路② 旧 access 令牌 → 401 + 10002（黑名单命中）
    C->>F: GET /api/v1/elders + Bearer A（已登出）
    F->>F: parse(A) 成功 → 查黑名单 命中 → writeUnauthorized
    F-->>C: HTTP 401 + R{code=10002}

    Note over C,GE: 链路③ 旧 refresh 令牌 → 换发失败
    C->>AS: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken:R}
    AS->>RT: findUserId(R) → null（已 revoke）
    AS-->>C: HTTP 200 + R{code=10002}

    Note over C,GE: 链路④ 未认证（无 Authorization）
    C->>F: 请求受保护端点（无 Bearer）
    F->>F: 无头 → 直接放行（不置身份）
    F->>EP: anyRequest().authenticated() 拒绝匿名
    EP-->>C: HTTP 401 + R{code=10002}

    Note over C,GE: 链路⑤ 已认证但无权码（第二闸）
    C->>PA: Bearer 有效，但 perms 不含所需码
    PA-->>GE: BizException(ROLE_NOT_PERMITTED=20003)
    GE-->>C: HTTP 200 + R{code=20003}
